<section class="section listening-values"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">The room's unwritten rules</p><div class="arrangement-grid"><article><span class="large-number">01</span><h2>Music first.</h2><p>The performance is the center of the evening. We imagine a room where even the softest phrase has a place.</p></article><article><span class="large-number">02</span><h2>Everyone in.</h2><p>New ears are welcome. You do not need to recognize a standard or know the names on a record sleeve.</p></article><article><span class="large-number">03</span><h2>Take it slowly.</h2><p>Let a side finish. Let a set unfold. A good evening does not need to hurry toward the next thing.</p></article></div></div></section>
